insert into seo_update values
  (1, 'pearlbeach-set-of-2-white-table-23-in', 'pearlbeach-set-of-2-white-table-23-in', 'Pearlbeach 23" White & Gold Tables, Set of 2', 'The Pearlbeach set pairs two round side tables with crisp white tops and open, curved frames in a warm gold finish. The two heights let you group them beside a sofa or split them between a bedside and a reading corner, and the airy bases keep any room feeling light. A versatile, modern-glam set for living rooms, bedrooms and entryways.', 'Pearlbeach set of two round side tables with white tops and open gold metal frames', false),
  (2, 'metal-55-coffee-table-silver', 'metal-55-coffee-table-silver', '55" Silver Metal & Glass Coffee Table', 'Clean-lined and quietly glamorous, this 55-inch coffee table sets a clear glass top on a polished silver metal frame with layered rectangular rails. The see-through top keeps large living rooms feeling open, while the mirror-bright frame reflects light around the room. Pair it with a neutral sofa and a plush rug for a sleek, modern lounge.', '55-inch rectangular coffee table with clear glass top and polished silver metal frame', false),
  (3, 'storage-ottoman-with-wooden-top', 'storage-ottoman-with-wooden-top', 'Round Storage Ottoman with Wood Lid', 'This round storage ottoman pairs soft oatmeal woven upholstery with a rich wood lid that lifts off to reveal a roomy hidden compartment. Use it as a footrest, an extra seat or a side table, and tuck away throws, toys or magazines inside. Curved, segmented sides give it a cosy, modern look in living rooms, bedrooms and dressing areas.', 'Round oatmeal upholstered storage ottoman with removable wood lid and open storage compartment', false),
  (4, '44-pleated-bench-w-legs-cream', '44-pleated-bench-w-legs-cream', 'Pleated 44" Cream Storage Bench, Gold Legs', 'Finished in finely pleated cream upholstery and raised on slim gold legs, this 44-inch bench brings a tailored, boutique-hotel feel to the foot of a bed or an entryway. The hinged seat opens to a lined storage compartment for spare linens, shoes or blankets. Elegant seating and smart storage in one piece.', '44-inch cream pleated storage bench with gold legs and hinged lid open to lined storage', false),
  (5, 'lucasbeach-ivory-chair-28', 'lucasbeach-ivory-chair-28', 'Lucasbeach 28" Ivory Bouclé Barrel Chair', 'The Lucasbeach chair wraps a deep, curved seat in soft ivory bouclé and floats it on a sweeping gold metal frame. Its barrel back hugs you comfortably, so it is as at home in a reading nook or bedroom corner as at the head of a dining table. A warm, modern-glam accent that brightens any room.', 'Lucasbeach ivory boucle barrel accent chair with curved gold metal sled base', false),
  (6, 'curved-back-wishbonechair-with-brown-oak-legs-gr', 'curved-back-accent-chair-gray-oak-legs', 'Curved Back Accent Chair, Gray with Oak Legs', 'Soft curves meet natural wood in this sculptural accent chair. The rounded, cushioned back and generous seat are covered in a textured gray fabric and set on warm brown oak legs with a distinctive wide back post. Use a pair at a dining table, or a single chair in a bedroom or office, for a modern, organic look.', 'Curved back accent chair in textured gray fabric with brown oak wood legs', false),
  (7, 'storage-ottoman', 'storage-ottoman', 'Pleated Oval Storage Ottoman, Beige', 'Gathered, pleated upholstery in soft beige gives this oval storage ottoman a luxurious, couture finish. The padded lid lifts on a hinge to reveal a spacious interior for blankets, pillows or games, and it rests on dark wood feet. Place it at the foot of the bed, in front of a sofa or in a dressing room.', 'Oval beige pleated storage ottoman with hinged padded lid open and dark wood feet', false),
  (8, 'accent-table', 'accent-table', 'Weathered Wood Octagon Pedestal Table', 'A turned, baluster-style wood pedestal rises to a generous octagonal top on this table, finished in a soft weathered grey-wash. At 28 inches wide and 30 inches high it works as a bistro table for two, a hallway centrepiece or a large lamp table. Farmhouse charm with a refined, timeless silhouette.', 'Octagonal weathered wood pedestal table with turned baluster base', false),
  (9, 'metal-22-h-orb-side-table-2-mirror-top-gld-blk', 'orb-22-mirror-top-side-table-gold-black', 'Orb 22" Mirror-Top Side Table, Gold & Black', 'Two stacked amber-gold glass orbs with a diamond pattern give this 22-inch side table real wow factor. A black base anchors the column, and the round black tray top is inset with a mirror that reflects lamps and accessories. A bold accent beside a sofa or armchair in glam and eclectic rooms.', '22-inch orb side table with two amber glass globes, black base and round mirror tray top', false),
  (10, 'metal-marble-glass-side-table-gold-white', 'metal-marble-glass-side-table-gold-white', 'Gold & White Marble-Glass Side Table', 'Polished gold metal frames two shelves of white marble-effect glass on this two-tier side table. The open, architectural frame gives it a crisp modern profile, and the lower shelf adds room for books, a tray or a plant. A glamorous finishing piece beside a sofa, bed or reading chair.', 'Two-tier gold metal side table with white marble-effect glass shelves', false),
  (11, 'basseux-acrylic-console-table', 'basseux-acrylic-console-table', 'Basseux 60" Acrylic Console Table', 'The Basseux console is a study in lightness: slim clear acrylic legs with gold-tone tips support a sleek 60-inch top that seems to float. It takes up little visual space in a hallway or behind a sofa while still giving you a long surface for lamps, books and decor. Modern, minimal and elegant.', 'Basseux 60-inch acrylic console table with slim clear legs and gold-tone feet', true),
  (12, 'metal-side-table-silver', 'metal-side-table-silver', 'Silver Metal Glass-Top Side Table, 24"', 'Layered, polished silver metal rails frame a clear glass top on this 24-inch square side table. Its crisp lines and reflective finish suit modern and glam interiors, and it sits neatly beside a sofa, armchair or bed. Also available with a gold frame.', '24-inch square side table with clear glass top and polished silver metal frame', true),
  (13, 'metal-top-21-h-nebular-side-table-frost', 'metal-top-21-h-nebular-side-table-frost', 'Nebular 21" Frosted Glass Side Table', 'The Nebular side table sets a textured silver-tone metal top on a tapered base of frosted glass, creating a soft, luminous look that feels both modern and organic. At 21 inches tall it is a natural height beside a sofa or armchair. Pair it with the 18-inch Nebular for a layered display.', 'Nebular 21-inch side table with frosted glass cone base and textured silver metal top', false),
  (14, 'metal-top-18-h-nebular-side-table-frost', 'metal-top-18-h-nebular-side-table-frost', 'Nebular 18" Frosted Glass Side Table', 'The Nebular side table sets a textured silver-tone metal top on a tapered base of frosted glass, creating a soft, luminous look that feels both modern and organic. At 18 inches tall it slips neatly beside a low chair or bed, or pairs with the 21-inch Nebular for a layered display.', 'Nebular 18-inch side table with frosted glass cone base and textured silver metal top', true),
  (15, '44-aldine-stainless-steel-coffee-table', '44-aldine-stainless-steel-coffee-table', 'Aldine 44" Stainless Steel Coffee Table, Black', 'The Aldine coffee table balances a sleek black top on slender stainless steel legs, grouped and fluted like architectural columns and joined by a crossed stretcher. At 44 inches it suits most living rooms and adds a refined, Art Deco-inspired note. Part of the Aldine collection, with a matching accent table and console.', 'Aldine 44-inch coffee table with black top and fluted stainless steel legs with X stretcher', false),
  (16, '23-aldine-stainless-steel-accent-table', '23-aldine-stainless-steel-accent-table', 'Aldine 23" Round Accent Table, Black', 'A round black top sits on clustered, fluted stainless steel legs on the Aldine accent table, giving it a slim, Art Deco-inspired silhouette. At 23 inches it is just right beside a sofa or chair for a lamp, drink or book. Pair it with the Aldine coffee table and console for a coordinated living room.', 'Aldine 23-inch round accent table with black top and fluted stainless steel legs', false),
  (17, '18-huzzah-quartz-resin-stool-white', 'fluted-white-boucle-ottomans-set-of-2', 'Fluted White Bouclé Ottomans, Set of 2', 'This pair of round ottomans is covered in cosy white bouclé and set on fluted natural wood bases. In 19-inch and 13-inch sizes, they group beautifully and work as footrests, extra seats or soft side tables in living rooms, bedrooms and children''s spaces.', 'Set of two round white boucle ottomans with fluted natural wood bases', false),
  (18, '40-taranto-wood-chest-white-wash', '40-taranto-wood-chest-white-wash', 'Taranto 40" White-Wash Wood Cabinet', 'Carved geometric diamond panels bring texture and depth to the Taranto cabinet, finished in a soft white-wash over natural wood. Two doors with a sculpted gold-tone pull open to storage, and slim gold legs lift it for a light, mid-century feel. Use it as a sideboard, bar cabinet or entryway chest.', 'Taranto 40-inch white-wash wood cabinet with carved geometric doors and gold legs', false),
  (19, '54-aldine-stainless-steel-console-table', '54-aldine-stainless-steel-console-table', 'Aldine 54" Stainless Steel Console Table, Black', 'The Aldine console sets a long black top on slender stainless steel legs, grouped and fluted like architectural columns and joined by a crossed stretcher. At 54 inches it is ideal for an entryway or behind a sofa, with room for lamps, books and decor. Pairs with the Aldine coffee and accent tables.', 'Aldine 54-inch console table with black top and fluted stainless steel legs', false),
  (20, '32x23-belova-cream-velvet-settee-kd', '32x23-belova-cream-velvet-settee-kd', 'Belova Cream Velvet Settee', 'The Belova settee has a soft, sculpted silhouette, with a curved back that sweeps along one side and a deep, rounded seat, all covered in plush cream velvet. Small gold-tipped feet add a touch of glamour. Compact at 32 by 23 inches, it fits a bedroom corner, dressing area or the end of a bed. Arrives flat-packed for simple assembly.', 'Belova cream velvet settee with curved asymmetrical back and gold-tipped feet', false),
  (21, 'brown-mango-wood-turned-side-end-accent-table', 'brown-mango-wood-turned-side-end-accent-table', 'Carved Mango Wood Pedestal Side Table', 'Hand-turned mango wood gives this pedestal side table a warm, characterful presence. A scalloped cut-out top sits on a turned column with four scrolled feet, finished in a rich brown that shows off the natural grain. It measures 24 by 24 inches and stands 31 inches tall, making it a natural lamp table, plant stand or bedside table.', 'Carved brown mango wood pedestal side table with scalloped top and scrolled feet', false),
  (22, 'round-wood-and-metal-kitchen-table-set', 'round-wood-and-metal-kitchen-table-set', 'Round Wood & Metal Bar Table Set with Stools', 'A space-saving bar table set with a round, textured wood top on a sturdy black metal frame. Folding stools with wood seats tuck neatly into the base when not in use. Standing 41 inches high with a 30-inch top, it suits kitchens, breakfast nooks, balconies and staff lounges in a modern industrial style.', 'Round wood-top bar table with black metal frame and folding stools tucked underneath', false),
  (23, 'sculptural-gold-marble-top-accent-table-elegant-artistic-and-timeless', 'sculptural-gold-marble-top-accent-table-elegant-artistic-and-timeless', 'Sculptural Gold & Marble Accent Table, 25"', 'A piece of functional art, this 25-inch accent table sets a round white marble top on a faceted, sculptural gold stem that rises from a solid marble base. Its twisting, organic form catches the light from every angle. Place it beside a sofa or chair, or use it as a statement drinks table in a modern, luxe living room.', '25-inch accent table with round white marble top, faceted gold sculptural stem and marble base', false),
  (24, 'gold-and-marble-console-table-42', 'gold-and-marble-console-table-42', 'Gold & Marble Pedestal Console Table, 42"', 'A genuine marble top rests on two bold, gold-finished pedestal columns on this 42-inch console table. Fluted detailing and softly rounded accents give it an elegant, architectural look with just the right touch of glamour. Perfect for an entryway, behind a sofa or as a styling table in a living or dining room.', '42-inch console table with white marble top and two gold pedestal column bases', false),
  (25, 'drawer-console-table', 'drawer-console-table', 'Warm Wood Sideboard with Woven Doors', 'Rich, warm wood meets natural texture in this statement sideboard. Two cabinet doors with woven seagrass-look panels flank three centre drawers with slim metal pulls, giving you generous storage, while round ball feet add a playful modern touch. Ideal in a dining room, living room or entryway for tableware, linens or media.', 'Warm wood sideboard with three centre drawers, two woven-panel doors and round ball feet', false),
  (26, 'entryway-table', 'entryway-table', 'Gold Arch Console Table with Mirror Top', 'Curved gold iron bars cross and sweep down into a striking funnel-shaped base on this entryway console, topped with a reflective mirrored surface. The satin gold finish and sculptural lines add instant glamour to a hallway, living room or bedroom. It measures 41 x 12 x 31 inches, slim enough for narrow entryways.', 'Gold metal console table with crossing arched legs and rectangular mirror top', false),
  (27, 'black-ribbed-oval-console-table', 'black-ribbed-oval-console-table', 'Black Fluted Oval Console Table', 'Make a sophisticated statement with this black oval console table. Its sleek, rounded-end top rests on two bold, fluted pillar legs for a sculptural look that feels both modern and timeless. Style it in an entryway with a lamp and mirror, or behind a sofa to define a living space.', 'Black oval console table with two fluted pillar legs', false),
  (28, 'marble-and-gold-sculptural-console-table', 'marble-and-gold-sculptural-console-table', 'Marble & Gold U-Base Console Table', 'A light marble top with subtle natural veining sits on a sweeping, gold-finished U-shaped base on this sculptural console table. The flowing, minimal silhouette brings modern elegance to an entryway, hallway or the back of a sofa, with plenty of room for lamps and decor.', 'Console table with white marble top and curved gold U-shaped metal base', false),
  (29, 'modern-elegance-accent-table', 'acrylic-gold-console-table-60', 'Acrylic & Gold Console Table, 60"', 'Airy and elegant, this 60-inch console table pairs clear acrylic legs with a reflective top and gold-tone trim, joined by a crossed gold stretcher. Its slim 14-inch depth keeps narrow entryways and hallways open while giving you a long display surface. It measures 60 x 14 x 29 inches, perfect behind a sofa or in a glam living room.', '60-inch acrylic console table with clear legs, reflective top and gold X stretcher', false),
  (30, 'metal-wood-42-three-tier-coffee-t', 'metal-wood-42-three-tier-coffee-table', 'Metal & Wood 42" Three-Tier Coffee Table', 'Three dark wood shelves at staggered heights give this 42-inch coffee table a modern, architectural profile. Slim brushed metal rods frame each level, leaving plenty of room for books, trays and decorative objects. A smart choice for contemporary living rooms that need both style and display space. Pairs with the 24-inch three-tier side table.', '42-inch three-tier coffee table with dark wood shelves and brushed metal frame', false),
  (31, '23016-contemporary-acc', 'contemporary-marble-top-accent-table-black', 'Contemporary Marble-Top Accent Table, Black', 'A round white stone-look top balances on a sculptural black base of two curved, interlocking legs on this contemporary accent table. The high-contrast palette and organic shape make it a striking side table beside a sofa, or a compact drinks table in a modern living room.', 'Contemporary accent table with round white top and sculptural curved black base', false),
  (32, 'metalwood-24-three-tier-side-table', 'metalwood-24-three-tier-side-table', 'Metal & Wood 24" Three-Tier Side Table', 'Three dark wood shelves at staggered heights sit within a slim brushed metal frame on this 24-inch side table. Its stepped, architectural shape offers display space for a lamp, books and plants while keeping a light footprint. Pairs with the 42-inch three-tier coffee table for a coordinated living room.', '24-inch three-tier side table with dark wood shelves and brushed metal frame', false),
  (33, '28-brunner-accent-chair-white-black', '28-brunner-accent-chair-white-black', 'Brunner 28" Accent Chair, White & Black', 'The Brunner accent chair frames a plush, textured white seat and back in a dark wood frame with gently angled open arms. Its clean, mid-century lines make it a natural fit for living rooms, bedrooms and reading corners, and it pairs easily with both modern and transitional decor.', 'Brunner accent chair with textured white upholstery and dark wood frame with open arms', false),
  (34, '33-dinasty-accent-chair-black', '33-dinasty-accent-chair-black', 'Dinasty 33" Accent Chair, Brown & Black', 'With distressed brown leather-look cushions and a slim black wood frame, the Dinasty chair brings a relaxed, mid-century lounge feel. Angled arms and a deep, padded seat make it a comfortable spot for reading or conversation in a living room, study or bedroom.', 'Dinasty accent chair with distressed brown leather-look cushions and black wood frame', false),
  (35, '31-astra-suede-wood-accent-chair', '31-astra-suede-wood-accent-chair', 'Astra 31" Gray Suede Accent Chair', 'The Astra chair wraps a softly curved back and padded seat in light gray suede-look fabric, supported by angled black wood legs that give it a sculptural, Scandinavian-inspired stance. Comfortable and compact, it works as a dining chair, desk chair or occasional chair in a bedroom.', 'Astra accent chair with curved light gray suede-look back and angled black wood legs', false),
  (36, 'the-clear-table', 'the-clear-table', 'Talia 21" Acrylic & Gold Accent Table', 'The Talia accent table sets a round, clear acrylic top on a slim gold column and weighted cylindrical base. At 21 inches it slides easily beside a sofa or bed, and its see-through top keeps small spaces feeling open and bright. A practical perch for a drink, phone or book with a modern, glam finish.', 'Talia 21-inch accent table with round clear acrylic top and gold metal stem and base', false),
  (37, 'side-table', 'gold-metal-glass-top-side-table-24', 'Gold Metal Glass-Top Side Table, 24"', 'Layered gold metal rails frame a clear tempered-glass top on this 24-inch square side table. Its modern, architectural design adds warmth and a touch of glamour beside a sofa, armchair or bed. It measures 24 x 24 x 24 inches. Also available with a silver frame.', '24-inch square side table with clear tempered glass top and polished gold metal frame', false),
  (38, '5-piece-glass-nesting-coffee-table-set-silver', '5-piece-glass-nesting-coffee-table-set-silver', '5-Piece Silver & Glass Nesting Coffee Table Set', 'Four triangular glass-top tables nest together to form one round coffee table in this clever 5-piece set, with polished silver metal frames throughout. Pull the pieces out as side tables or extra surfaces when you entertain, then slide them back in for a tidy, circular centrepiece. Modern design with smart, flexible function.', 'Five-piece round nesting coffee table set with clear glass tops and silver metal frames', false),
  (39, 'modern-round-white-and-gold-coffee-table-timeless-elegance-meets-modern-luxury', 'modern-round-white-and-gold-coffee-table-timeless-elegance-meets-modern-luxury', 'Round White & Gold Coffee Table, 35"', 'Bright and refined, this 35-inch round coffee table pairs a white top with subtle marble-look veining and a champagne-gold metal base. Rounded leg tops and a cross stretcher give it a soft, contemporary profile that suits modern and glam living rooms alike.', '35-inch round coffee table with white marble-look top and champagne gold metal legs', false),
  (40, 'entryway-table-2', 'gold-fluted-oval-console-table-47', 'Gold Fluted Oval Console Table, 47"', 'Two ribbed pillar legs in a matte gold finish support an oval marble top on this statement console table. Welded from iron for a sturdy frame, it measures 46.5 x 15 x 30.8 inches, ideal for an entryway, hallway or behind a sofa. A classic shape with a glamorous twist. Wipe clean with a dry cloth.', '47-inch oval console table with marble top and two fluted gold pillar legs', false),
  (41, 'marble-and-gold-kidney-console-table', 'marble-and-gold-kidney-console-table', 'Allessa 40" Marble & Gold Console Table', 'The Allessa console pairs a kidney-shaped marble top with a matching lower shelf, set on slim, angled gold-tone metal legs. Soft organic curves and subtle natural veining give it an airy, sophisticated look in an entryway, hallway or living room, with extra display space below.', 'Allessa 40-inch console table with kidney-shaped marble top, lower shelf and angled gold legs', false);
